  "body_html": "<h1>top_unanimity_of_unanimity</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem top_unanimity_of_unanimity [Nonempty A] {f : VotingRule N A} (hf : IsTotal f) (hU : Unanimity f) : ∀ (P : Profile N A) (a : A), (∀ i : N, TopRank P i a) → f P = {a}</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>VotingRule</li>\n<li>IsTotal</li>\n<li>Unanimity</li>\n<li>Profile</li>\n<li>TopRank</li>\n</ul>",
